      "Snapshot\nPERIOD END\n~£1,981\nPERIOD HIGH\n£2,055.86\nCASH BALANCE\n£40.07",
      "The past four weeks have been the most active period of the portfolio so far. I traded Microsoft, re-entered Alphabet, sold ASML for a strong profit, added to gold, bought SpaceX, increased Symbotic and introduced Pershing Square Holdings.",
